iptic\",\r\n    \"Yahoo Finance\",\r\n    \"Bank Policy Institute\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"source_urls\": [\r\n    \"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/14/live-senate-banking-committee-holds-key-hearing-to-advance-clarity-act\",\r\n    \"https://news.google.?oc=5\",\r\n    \"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPV0xNYnVyN3Azam53dlJTTUZLZFhmY29FbGhtWXpsREx5Q1A2OEVmcVd5WFBvMno3N2lJNC1KaFJQQTVkQUt2SnEtOU82eXZFVzM5QzZYOHA1VTVZSDhKazJCSmVLbHBubW9FRGZvdmFGZmtwNnU0bXlPaGRxZDJCMGVaUlNRXzZ6WTdDWWlSbVBxeG9uU29ULVNfVUlZSWc?oc=5\",\r\n    \"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPcmZncUx4SWRRVmtDcGN1eGZ4MTdCTzVlNldTR2dPTkpZcDY0SjE3WVhIUDBfU0hMY3hIWjdESk9CZW1fRG5DcEtmWDRIVTlmRW9xSXBIcVV0eHpXOVpDRlNrTHhGUHNHcGNKWUlGdE1lQkRxOXRybEV5YUVpM0xrM0k3VmtRZE5FYzRSOGNNeXM4Zkktc3lZ?oc=5\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"combined_key_facts\": [\r\n    \"CoinDesk’s live feed headline says the Senate Banking Committee advanced the CLARITY Act to the full Senate floor, marking the central event.\",\r\n    \"Google News surfaced multiple same-day articles dated Thu, 14 May 2026 covering the same committee action, including CNBC, Elliptic, Yahoo Finance, and the Bank Policy Institute.\",\r\n    \"A Google News item from CNBC described the event as a 'crypto industry scores win' moment after the CLARITY Act regulation bill cleared a Senate hurdle.\",\r\n    \"Another Google News item from Elliptic said the 'CLARITY Act advances from Senate Banking Committee,' confirming cross-source coverage of the same development.\",\r\n    \"The Bank Policy Institute item explicitly referenced a 'Senate Banking Committee Vote to Advance Clarity Act,' adding institutional confirmation from the banking-policy side.\",\r\n    \"The matching headlines all point to a market-structure bill moving forward in the Senate, making this the single biggest crypto policy event in the available feeds.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"aggregated_raw_content\": \"CoinDesk RSS headline and snippet: \\\"LIVE: Senate Banking Committee advances Clarity Act to full Senate floor\\\" with the related feed item published Thu, 14 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000. CoinDesk’s page title signals that the Senate Banking Committee advanced the Clarity Act and that the bill is moving to the full Senate floor.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Crypto industry scores win as Clarity Act regulation bill clears Senate hurdle - CNBC\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 17:49:33 GMT. The RSS description shows the CNBC headline and attributes it to CNBC, describing the development as a win for the crypto industry after the CLARITY Act regulation bill cleared a Senate hurdle.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Chairman Scott, Senators Lummis, Tillis Release Market Structure Bill Text Ahead of Banking Committee Markup - Senate Committee on Banking, Housing, and Urban Affairs (.gov)\\\". This result appears in the same-day Google News cluster and ties the CLARITY Act discussion to the committee markup process and the release of market structure bill text ahead of the hearing/markup.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Banking Trades Statement on Senate Banking Committee Vote to Advance Clarity Act - Bank Policy Institute\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 17:50:00 GMT. The item confirms that banking-industry trade groups issued a statement about the committee vote to advance the Clarity Act.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Crypto regulatory affairs: CLARITY Act advances from Senate Banking Committee - Elliptic\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 17:49:33 GMT. The item confirms the same legislative motion from a compliance and crypto-risk perspective, using the language that the CLARITY Act advances from the Senate Banking Committee.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Clarity Act Clears U.S. Senate Committee - Yahoo Finance\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 17:50:00 GMT. The Yahoo Finance item compresses the event to the core fact that the Clarity Act cleared a U.S. Senate committee.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"The Clarity Act to Advance in the Senate, Pitting Banks Against Crypto and VC - inc.com\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 21:39:20 GMT. This adds broader framing that the bill’s advancement has implications for banks, crypto, and venture capital, though the core event remains the same Senate movement.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Clarity Act clears Senate Banking Committee - ledgerinsights.com\\\" published Thu, 14 May 2026 18:22:13 GMT. This is another same-day cross-reference confirming the committee clearance.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Crypto industry scores win as Clarity Act regulation bill clears Senate hurdle - CNBC\\\" and \\\"Clarity Act Clears U.S. Senate Committee - Yahoo Finance\\\" show the same event being picked up by major business/news outlets within hours.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Banking Trades Statement on Senate Banking Committee Vote to Advance Clarity Act - Bank Policy Institute\\\" confirms reaction from banking-policy circles.\\n\\nGoogle News RSS result: \\\"Crypto regulatory affairs: CLARITY Act advances from Senate Banking Committee - Elliptic\\\" confirms the regulatory significance for the crypto industry.\\n\\nTogether, these headlines and snippets indicate a single major U.S. crypto policy event: the Senate Banking Committee advancing the CLARITY Act / market structure bill, with multiple outlets treating it as a meaningful legislative win for crypto and a notable step toward full Senate consideration.\"\r\n}\r\n","name":"rm ~/.openclaw/agents/res...sessions/sessions.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778829552484}}
