{"type":"message","id":"108d0386","parentId":"8025a586","timestamp":"2026-05-15T07:19:49.319Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-15 07:17 UTC] An async command the user already approved has completed.\nDo not run the command again.\nIf the task requires more steps, continue from this result before replying to the user.\nOnly ask the user for help if you are actually blocked.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec finished (gateway id=c52ec27e-0728-42f7-a666-f10f99f10a89, session=glow-crustacean, code 0)\noin Hits $82,000, Coinbase Leads Crypto Stock Gains as Clarity Act Advances.\\\"\\n- \\\"Bitcoin tops $82k as crypto bill clears Senate panel.\\\"\\n- \\\"US Senate committee advances crypto bill in milestone for digital assets.\\\"\\n\\nThis is a single-event, cross-source summary centered on the CLARITY Act advancing through the Senate Banking Committee and the immediate crypto-market rally that followed.\" }\n\nContinue the task if needed, then reply to the user in a helpful way.\nIf it succeeded, share the relevant output.\nIf it failed, explain what went wrong."}],"timestamp":1778829589317}}
